{"mode":"test","title":"","instruction":{"english":"","german":""},"readingText":{"instruction":{"german":"<p>Read the article. Then go to Exercise.<\/p>","english":""},"content":"<p><b>What colour are your clothes?<\/b><\/p><p>Clothes help protect us from the weather. It\u2019s a good idea to wear light colours, like white or yellow, when it\u2019s hot. People often wear dark colours \u2013 like black or brown \u2013 in the winter. But clothes can also make us feel good. And that can be because of their colour.&nbsp;<\/p><p><b>Yellow<\/b><\/p><p>Have you got a yellow shirt or T-shirt? Yellow is a happy colour. It\u2019s the colour of the sun!<b>&nbsp;<\/b><\/p><p><b>Green<\/b><\/p><p>Are your jumpers or sweatshirts green? Plants and trees are green. Green is the colour of nature. Are you a nature-lover?&nbsp;<\/p><p><b>Blue<\/b><\/p><p>Are you wearing blue trousers or a blue skirt? Blue is the colour of the sky and the sea. It makes us feel quiet and calm.&nbsp;<\/p><p><b>Red<\/b><\/p><p>This colour has many meanings. One of them is love. Another one is power! How do you feel when you are wearing red clothes?&nbsp;<\/p><p><b>Black<\/b><\/p><p>This is another colour that means \u2018power\u2019! Black is also easy to wear because it goes with lots of other colours. How many of your clothes are black?&nbsp;<\/p><p>So, have you got a favourite colour? Is it blue, green or red? Next time you choose your clothes, think about their colours and what they mean!<\/p>","showOnStart":true,"configs":[]},"sequences":[{"instruction":{"german":"<p><b>Match the sentence halves.<\/b><\/p>","english":""},"configs":[{"additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"green.","correct":false},{"answer":"is a happy colour.","correct":false},{"answer":"can mean \u2018love\u2019 or \u2018power\u2019.","correct":false},{"answer":"is an easy colour to wear.","correct":false},{"answer":"are good to wear in hot weather.","correct":true},{"answer":"can help us feel calm.","correct":false},{"answer":"in cold wea